                <img class="img-fluid"  src="https://www.dp.org.tr/storage/posts/August2021/6gweHZjFXxwG3lgjIX7t.jpg"  alt="">
                <div class="mt-2 date ml-auto" style="display: flex; float:left">16/04/2021</div>
                <ul style="display:flex; float:right; margin-top:10px">
                    <li style="margin-right:10px" class="ml-3"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://www.dp.org.tr/haber/demokrat-parti-genel-baskani-gultekin-uysal-dan-chp-genel-baskani-kemal-kilicdaroglu-nun-fezleke-ve-dokunulmazlik-dosyalarinin-tbmm-ye-sunulmasina-elestiri"><i style="font-size:20px; color:#4D4D4D" class="fab fa-facebook"></i></a></li>
                    <li style="margin-right:10px" class="ml-3"><a href="https://twitter.com/share?url=https://www.dp.org.tr/haber/demokrat-parti-genel-baskani-gultekin-uysal-dan-chp-genel-baskani-kemal-kilicdaroglu-nun-fezleke-ve-dokunulmazlik-dosyalarinin-tbmm-ye-sunulmasina-elestiri"><i style="font-size:20px; color:#4D4D4D" class="fab fa-twitter"></i></a></li>
                    <li style="margin-right:10px" class="ml-3"><a href="http://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?url=https://www.dp.org.tr/haber/demokrat-parti-genel-baskani-gultekin-uysal-dan-chp-genel-baskani-kemal-kilicdaroglu-nun-fezleke-ve-dokunulmazlik-dosyalarinin-tbmm-ye-sunulmasina-elestiri"><i style="font-size:20px; color:#4D4D4D" class="fab fa-linkedin"></i></a></li>
                </ul>
                <h1>Demokrat Parti Genel Başkanı Gültekin Uysal’dan, CHP Genel Başkanı Kemal Kılıçdaroğlu’nun fezleke ve dokunulmazlık dosyalarının TBMM’ye sunulmasına eleştiri</h1>
                <br>
                <br>
                <br>
                <p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Demokrat Parti Genel Başkanı G&uuml;ltekin Uysal&rsquo;dan, CHP Genel Başkanı Kemal Kılı&ccedil;daroğlu&rsquo;nun fezleke ve dokunulmazlık dosyalarının TBMM&rsquo;ye sunulmasına eleştiri</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&ldquo;T&uuml;rkiye&rsquo;de demokratik rekabetin meşru sınırlarını hepten yok edecek bir hamle&rdquo;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><strong><em style="mso-bidi-font-style: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&ldquo;AKP&rsquo;nin beyin &ouml;l&uuml;m&uuml; ger&ccedil;ekleşti&rdquo;</span></em></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">(DP Basın Merkezi &ndash; 16 Nisan 2021) Demokrat Parti Genel Başkanı G&uuml;ltekin Uysal, CHP Genel Başkanı Kemal Kılı&ccedil;daroğlu&rsquo;nun fezleke ve dokunulmazlık dosyalarının TBMM&rsquo;ye sunulmasına eleştiride bulundu.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Uysal yaptığı a&ccedil;ıklamada dokunulmazlığı kaldırma teşebb&uuml;s&uuml;n&uuml;n siyasi iklimi zehirlemeye y&ouml;nelik olduğuna vurgu yaparak; teşebb&uuml;s&uuml;, &ldquo;T&uuml;rkiye&rsquo;de demokratik rekabetin meşru sınırlarını hepten yok edecek bir hamle&rdquo; olarak değerlendirdi. </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Demokrat Parti Genel Başkanı G&uuml;ltekin Uysal, şunları kaydetti:</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><strong><em style="mso-bidi-font-style: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&ldquo;AKP&rsquo;de kendini kurtaracak hi&ccedil;bir demokratik form&uuml;l&uuml;n kalmadığı d&uuml;ş&uuml;ncesi hakim&rdquo;</span></em></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&ldquo;CHP Genel Başkanı Kemal Kılı&ccedil;daroğlu&rsquo;nun dokunulmazlığını kaldırma teşebb&uuml;s&uuml; &lsquo;Siyasi iklimi zehirleme&rsquo; ayarlı! Anlaşılan AKP&rsquo;de kendini kurtaracak hi&ccedil;bir demokratik form&uuml;l&uuml;n kalmadığına dair bir d&uuml;ş&uuml;nce h&acirc;kim olmuş!</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><strong><em style="mso-bidi-font-style: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&ldquo;Demokratik rekabeti yok edecek hamle&rdquo;</span></em></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">CHP İl/İl&ccedil;e Başkanlıklarındaki &lsquo;128 Milyar $ Ne Oldu&rsquo; afişlerinin zorbalıkla indirilmesinin ardından Ana muhalefet liderinin dokunulmazlığını kaldırmak i&ccedil;in yapılan hazırlık artık T&uuml;rkiye&rsquo;de demokratik rekabetin meşru sınırlarını hepten yok edecek bir hamle.&rdquo;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><strong><em style="mso-bidi-font-style: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&ldquo;AKP&rsquo;nin beyin &ouml;l&uuml;m&uuml; ger&ccedil;ekleşti&rdquo;</span></em></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Genel Başkan Uysal, d&uuml;n paylaştığı videoda da AKP&rsquo;nin son g&uuml;nlerdeki eylemlerini (&ldquo;128 milyar dolar nerede?&rdquo; afişlerinin zorbalıkla indirilmesi,<span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp; </span>patates-soğan dağıtım t&ouml;renleri ) sert bir dille eleştirmiş, b&uuml;t&uuml;n bunların AKP&rsquo;nin beyin &ouml;l&uuml;m&uuml;n&uuml;n ger&ccedil;ekleştiğini g&ouml;sterdiğini ifade etmişti. </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Uysal, AKP&rsquo;nin beyin &ouml;l&uuml;m&uuml;n&uuml;n ger&ccedil;ekleştiğini s&ouml;ylediği videoda şunları dile getirdi:</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&ldquo;Adalet ve Kalkınma Partisi&rsquo;nin bir taraftan, &ouml;zellikle son birka&ccedil; g&uuml;nd&uuml;r CHP&rsquo;nin il ve il&ccedil;e binalarına astığı &lsquo;128 milyar dolar nerede?&rsquo; pankartlarını valilikler kaymakamlıklar eliyle indirmeye &ccedil;alışması, &ouml;b&uuml;r taraftan da neredeyse Ay&rsquo;a adam g&ouml;nderme t&ouml;renlerine benzer patates ve soğan dağıtım t&ouml;renleri yapıyor olmaları AKP&rsquo;nin beyin &ouml;l&uuml;m&uuml;n&uuml;n ger&ccedil;ekleştiğini g&ouml;steriyor&rdquo; diye konuştu.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;</span></p></p>
            </div>
        </div>
            </div>
</section>


